    <title>Tinashe – Popstar</title>
    <link>https://pitchfork.com/reviews/albums/tinashe-popstar/</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://pitchfork.com/reviews/albums/tinashe-popstar/</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:03:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <enclosure url="https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6ab4131ef7ef2378a6776d41/16:9/w_1280,c_limit/Tinashe-%20Popstar%20.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/>
    <description><![CDATA[<p>Tinashe’s eighth album is her best and bravest yet: more ambitious, more focused, and effortlessly in touch with the zeitgeist. It’s the best pop album of the year.</p>
<img src="https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6ab4131ef7ef2378a6776d41/16:9/w_1280,c_limit/Tinashe-%20Popstar%20.jpg" alt="Popstar cover"/>
