    <description><![CDATA[<p>After records steeped in grief and heartbreak, the singer’s latest album is framed as a laid-back ode to Los Angeles, but it can be tough to tease out the substance behind the sunny vibes.</p>
<img src="https://media.pitchfork.com/photos/6abbc506df6776cb6ab029e4/16:9/w_1280,c_limit/Jhene%CC%81%20Aiko%20-%20Westside%20Whimsy.jpg" alt="Westside Whimsy cover"/>
